#
# Which conditions are pushed down: the conditions that FastBit evaluates
# have no Filter in the plan.  SET, JSON, TEXT and GEOMETRY values
# are compared by MySQL.
#
EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE SELECT COUNT(*) FROM w WHERE ti > 1;
EXPLAIN
-> Aggregate: count(0)  
    -> Table scan on w  

Warnings:
Note	1003	/* select#1 */ select count(0) AS `COUNT(*)` from `test`.`w` where (`test`.`w`.`ti` > 1)
